(object Class_Category "Graphics2D"
    is_unit    	TRUE
    is_loaded  	TRUE
    quid       	"37BC8ED5008F"
    documentation 	
|Defines different Levels of Graphics capabilities. 
|This Model is oriented after the Publish/Subscribe Model of the Java Graphics, where the Representation is assumed to be remote from the Source. 
|Thus the basic Operation is setting a single Point with a Color. Based on this all other Operations are defined, but can be overridden by binary or more effective Algorithms. 
|The Operations all deal with int Types for speed Reasons.
    
    visible_categories 	(list visibility_relationship_list
	(object Visibility_Relationship
	    quid       	"37BFE7860044"
	    supplier   	"Logical View::java::awt::image"
	    quidu      	"34B0F6CD00D0")
	(object Visibility_Relationship
	    quid       	"37BFE790031A"
	    supplier   	"Logical View::java::awt"
	    quidu      	"34B0F6CD00CE"))
