|Moves this point to the specificed location in the 
|     * (<i>x</i>,&nbsp;<i>y</i>) coordinate plane. This method
|     * is identical with <code>setLocation(int,&nbsp;int)</code>.
|     * @param       x  the <i>x</i> coordinate of the new location.
