|Draws a fractal Line between P and P1. 
|	 * The Dimension is determined by Waviness within [0,2]
|	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "P1"
			    type       	"Point2D"))
		    result     	"void"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
