		    quid       	"37BD367E03D0"
		    documentation 	
|Generates and Paints the Bezier Spline given by the Lead Points in [Px, Py].	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "PX"
			    type       	"int[]")
			(object Parameter "PY"
			    type       	"int[]")
			(object Parameter "numInter"
