		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BC8ED6009B"
		    documentation 	
|This is the Waviness for the drawFracLine() Routine.
|	 * It determines it's fractal Dimension. 
|	 * With Waviness = 0 the Dimension is 1,	
