		(object Attribute
		    tool       	"Java"
		    name       	"Final"
		    value      	TRUE))
	    quid       	"37BC8ED60109"
	    documentation 	
|This Class has no state and therefore only static Methods.
| * It is a Container for some fractal Methods. 
| * 
| * Backtracking the Turtle works, due to no rounding errors, 
| * still it is faster to just buffer the old Location. 
| 
	    
	    operations 	(list Operations
		(object Operation "Octave"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set
			(object Attribute
			    tool       	"Java"
			    name       	"Static"
			    value      	TRUE))
		    quid       	"37BD36800040"
		    documentation 	
|Returns the first Number for which (1 >> Octave) > num	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "num"
			    type       	"int"))
		    result     	"byte"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "Plasma"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set
			(object Attribute
			    tool       	"Java"
			    name       	"Static"
			    value      	TRUE))
		    quid       	"37BD36800042"
		    documentation 	
|Generates a 2-dimensional integer Array with pseudorandom Numbers (Fractal). 
|	 * Returns the range of Values (Minimum in x, Maximum in y)	
|	 * This Algorithm can easily be extended to work in any number of Dimensions. 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "FarbStep"
			    type       	"int")
			(object Parameter "Picture"
			    type       	"int[][]")
			(object Parameter "decrement"
			    type       	"boolean"))
		    result     	"Point2D"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
