	    quid       	"37BC8ED6025D"
	    documentation 	
|Implements the Hidden Line Algorithm. 
| * Drawing reserves a Space between the lowest and highest Coordinate. 
| * If you draw from Front to Back, all hidden Lines and Pixels are not drawn.
| * 
| * Design Decisions:
| * To avoid the costly indexed Array accesses, temporary Min and Max Values are kept, 
| * which are only updated when the x Coordinate changed.
| 
	    
	    operations 	(list Operations
		(object Operation "Hidden"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD3688000F"
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "MaxX"
			    type       	"int"))
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
