		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "relax"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD3688001B"
		    documentation 	
|Relaxation of the Borders 
|	 * by setting all Values to comparable Values as the one next to it.
|	 
		    
