		(object Operation "P2_Plot"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD36900079"
		    documentation 	
|This Routines takes two Vectors [xP,xP] and draws Markers on the Points:
|	 * The Radiuses of the Markers are given by [xR,yR], otherwise by the given Radiuses.
|	 * The Points are optionally connected and closed.	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "xP"
			    type       	"int[]")
			(object Parameter "yP"
			    type       	"int[]"))
		    result     	"void"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "P2_Plot"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD3690007C"
		    documentation 	
|This Routines takes two Vectors [xP,xP] and draws Markers on the Points:
|	 * The Radiuses of the Markers are optionally given by [xR,yR], 
|	 * otherwise by the default Radiuses of this Instance.
|	 * The Points are optionally connected and closed.
|	 * Additionally the Lot for each Point can be drawn to the x or y Axis
|	 * with the Coordinates y0 or x0 respectively.	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "xP"
			    type       	"int[]")
			(object Parameter "yP"
			    type       	"int[]")
			(object Parameter "xR"
			    type       	"int[]")
			(object Parameter "yR"
			    type       	"int[]")
			(object Parameter "x0"
			    type       	"int")
			(object Parameter "y0"
			    type       	"int")
			(object Parameter "connect"
			    type       	"boolean")
			(object Parameter "closed"
			    type       	"boolean")
			(object Parameter "LotX"
			    type       	"boolean")
			(object Parameter "LotY"
			    type       	"boolean"))
		    result     	"void"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "P2_Plot"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD36900087"
		    documentation 	
|This Routines takes a Vector P[] and draws Markers on the Points:
|	 * The Radiuses of the Markers are optionally given by R[], 
|	 * otherwise by the default Radiuses of this Instance.
|	 * The Points are optionally connected and closed.
|	 * Additionally the Lot for each Point can be drawn to the x or y Axis
|	 * with the Coordinates y0 or x0 respectively.	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "P"
			    type       	"Point2D[]")
			(object Parameter "R"
			    type       	"Point2D[]")
			(object Parameter "x0"
			    type       	"int")
			(object Parameter "y0"
			    type       	"int")
			(object Parameter "connect"
			    type       	"boolean")
			(object Parameter "closed"
			    type       	"boolean")
			(object Parameter "LotX"
			    type       	"boolean")
			(object Parameter "LotY"
			    type       	"boolean"))
		    result     	"void"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0))
